139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 109 0 R
/T (Privacy policies are the legal instrument through which consent is obtained. We tested whether they describe reality. Across the 100 most-visited websites in Europe, we measured what each site does on arrival \(before any consent is given\) and separately scored its written privacy policy against the data-protection principles of GDPR Article 5. The two are unrelated.)
/E (Privacy policies are the legal instrument through which consent is obtained. We tested whether they describe reality. Across the 100 most-visited websites in Europe, we measured what each site does on arrival \(before any consent is given\) and separately scored its written privacy policy against the data-protection principles of GDPR Article 5. The two are unrelated.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
