/T (We treat the privacy policy as a claim, and the site's observable conduct as evidence about that claim. We then ask a question that has not, to our knowledge, been asked at this scale for the European context: does a well written privacy tell us what the company does with our data?)
/E (We treat the privacy policy as a claim, and the site's observable conduct as evidence about that claim. We then ask a question that has not, to our knowledge, been asked at this scale for the European context: does a well written privacy tell us what the company does with our data?)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
