<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Each site was assessed twice. It was first measured with an instrumented Chromium browser which loaded each homepage from a clean profile and recorded: every distinct third-party domain contacted; cookies set before any consent interaction; which consent management platform was present; whether the IAB Transparency & Consent Framework \(`__tcfapi`\) or Global Privacy Platform \(`__gpp`\) interfaces were exposed; whether a first-layer "reject all" control existed; and which permission APIs the page invoked. The linked privacy policy was fetched separately, its text extracted, word-counted, and hashed. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
