289 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (And lastly, for people using the web. The finding here is not that you should read privacy policies more carefully. It is that reading them would not tell you what you want to know - and would cost you 25 minutes per site to discover that. The disclosure regime as currently practised does not equip an individual to make an informed choice.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
