/Title (Privacy policies are the legal instrument through which consent is obtained. We tested whether they describe reality. Across the 100 most-visited websites in Europe, we measured what each site does on arrival \(before any consent is given\) and separately scored its written privacy policy against the data-protection principles of GDPR Article 5. The two are unrelated.)
