/Title (Article 5\(3\) of the ePrivacy Directive requires prior consent for storing non-essential information on a user's device. Some share of these cookies will be strictly necessary and therefore exempt. But a median of six and a maximum of thirty-six, before a visitor has clicked anything is difficult to reconcile with a regime built on prior consent.)
